{"3089820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ZOMBIE RECALL VR", "steam_appid": 3089820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced, action-packed shooter</strong> with a fluid user experience, engaging physics, and a variety of enemies and mechanics to avoid boring game-loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZOMBIE RECALL</strong> is a work-in-progress developed by a small team that started two years ago. We believe the game is now ready to be tested and supported by true VR players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Early Access Beta</strong> is a two-hour experience that we released to gather community feedback on the content and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ART:</strong> Located in a distopic future, with retro-futuristic vibes and techno-like music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced, action-packed shooter</strong> with a fluid user experience, engaging physics, and a variety of enemies and mechanics to avoid boring game-loops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ZOMBIE RECALL</strong> is a work-in-progress developed by a small team that started two years ago. We believe the game is now ready to be tested and supported by true VR players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Early Access Beta</strong> is a two-hour experience that we released to gather community feedback on the content and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE ART:</strong> Located in a distopic future, with retro-futuristic vibes and techno-like music. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "ZOMBIE RECALL Early Access Beta is a rogue-lite, toon-gore Arcade Shooter designed for MidCore and Hardcore VR players. Dismember enemies and send them flying! Be part of the development – we need your feedback